graph TD
    A[Start] --> B[Camera Frame]
    B --> C[3x3 Colour Grid]
    C --> D[HSV Mask: red/green/purple/orange/blue/black]
    D --> E[Contour Detection]
    E --> F{Target Selection}
    F -->|Corridor| G[Centre on lane]
    F -->|Red Pillar| H[Pass right +12°]
    F -->|Green Pillar| I[Pass left -12°]
    F -->|Parking| J[Detect purple blocks]
    G --> K[PD Steering]
    H --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K
    K --> L[Dynamic Drive Speed]
    L --> M[Send CMD to ESP32]
    M --> N{Lap Count >= 3?}
    N -->|No| B
    N -->|Yes| O[Send PARK]
    O --> P[IMU Align + ToF Stop]
    P --> Q[Finish]

    style A fill:#c8e6c9
    style Q fill:#ffcdd2
    style H fill:#ffcdd2
    style I fill:#c8e6c9
    style J fill:#e1bee7
